---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Career
eyebrow: Career
lead: 고객의 시스템을 끝까지 책임지는 동료를 찾습니다.
section: career
description: (주)트라이얼정보통신의 인재상, 복리후생, 채용 절차와 진행 중인 공고를 안내합니다.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">People</p>
      <h2 class="section__title">이런 분과 함께하고 싶습니다</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {%- for item in career.values %}
      <div class="feature reveal">
        <p class="feature__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ loop.index }}</p>
        <h3 class="feature__title">{{ item.title }}</h3>
        <p class="feature__text">{{ item.text }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__eyebrow">Openings</p>
      <h2 class="section__title">채용 공고</h2>
    </div>

    {%- if career.openings.length %}
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {%- for job in career.openings %}
      <article class="section-card reveal">
        <p class="section-card__label">{{ job.title }}</p>
        <p class="section-card__text">
          {{ job.type }} · {{ job.place }}{% if job.period %} · {{ job.period }}{% endif %}
        </p>
        {%- if job.tasks and job.tasks.length %}
        <div>
          <h3 class="field__label">담당 업무</h3>
          <ul class="product-card__features">
            {%- for task in job.tasks %}<li>{{ task }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if job.requires and job.requires.length %}
        <div>
          <h3 class="field__label">자격 요건</h3>
          <ul class="product-card__features">
            {%- for req in job.requires %}<li>{{ req }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
        <p>
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}?subject={{ ('[입사지원] ' + job.title) | urlencode }}">
            지원하기
          </a>
        </p>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- else %}
    <div class="notice">
      <p class="notice__title">현재 공개된 공고는 없습니다</p>
      <p>
        상시 지원은 언제나 환영합니다. 이력서와 경력기술서를
        <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a> 으로 보내주시면
        검토 후 연락드립니다.
      </p>
      <div class="notice__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}?subject={{ '[입사지원] 상시지원' | urlencode }}">
          이력서 보내기
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split split--aside">
      <div>
        <div class="section__head">
          <p class="section__eyebrow">Process</p>
          <h2 class="section__title">전형 절차</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          {%- for step in career.process %}
          <div class="step reveal">
            <h3 class="step__title">{{ step.title }}</h3>
            <p class="step__text">{{ step.text }}</p>
          </div>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="section__head">
          <p class="section__eyebrow">Benefits</p>
          <h2 class="section__title">복리후생</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="product-card__features">
          {%- for item in career.benefits %}
          <li>{{ item }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
